"Replace:" = "Ersätt:";
"Still reached from: %@." = "Nås fortfarande från: %@.";
"Tag %@" = "Tagg %@";
"Text to find in the messages" = "Text att söka efter i meddelandena";
"The %lld changes:" = "De %lld ändringarna:";
"The %lld old commits are gone from this repository." = "De %lld gamla commits är borta från det här arkivet.";
"The %lld selected commits" = "De %lld markerade commits";
"The branches and tags go back to the old commits — if none of them has moved since." = "Grenarna och taggarna går tillbaka till de gamla commits — om ingen av dem har flyttats sedan dess.";
"The commit messages were last rewritten on %@. The old commits are kept so that it can be undone." = "Commit-meddelandena skrevs senast om %@. De gamla commits behålls så att det kan ångras.";
"The current branch" = "Den aktuella grenen";
"The history could not be read. Nothing was changed." = "Historiken kunde inte läsas. Inget ändrades.";
"The message of %@ is not stored as UTF-8 and cannot be changed here." = "Meddelandet för %@ är inte lagrat som UTF-8 och kan inte ändras här.";
"The message of %@ would be empty. A commit needs a message." = "Meddelandet för %@ skulle bli tomt. En commit behöver ett meddelande.";
"The regular expression is not valid." = "Det reguljära uttrycket är ogiltigt.";
"The remote branches are replaced by the rewritten ones — with a lease: if somebody pushed to them since they were fetched, the push is refused instead." = "Fjärrgrenarna ersätts med de omskrivna — med en lease: har någon pushat till dem sedan de hämtades, vägras pushen i stället.";
"The selected commit" = "Den markerade commiten";
"There is no backup of that rewrite any more." = "Det finns ingen säkerhetskopia av den omskrivningen längre.";
"This is about this repository only. Commits that were pushed may still be reachable at the server — through pull requests, forks or caches — and in every clone. A secret that was pushed has to be revoked or changed." = "Det här gäller bara det här arkivet. Commits som pushats kan fortfarande nås på servern — via pull requests, forkar eller cachar — och i varje klon. En hemlighet som pushats måste återkallas eller ändras.";
"Undo" = "Ångra";
"Undo the rewrite of the commit messages?" = "Ångra omskrivningen av commit-meddelandena?";
"Undone: %@ are back on the old commits." = "Ångrat: %@ är tillbaka på de gamla commits.";
"Was: %@" = "Var: %@";
"Whole words" = "Hela ord";
"edited" = "redigerat";
"in %lld commit(s)" = "i %lld commit(s)";
"left as it is" = "lämnat som det är";
"pushed." = "pushat.";
"%@ still has the old commits. Force-push the rewritten branches first; removing the old commits before that would make the force-push impossible." = "%@ har fortfarande de gamla commitsen. Tvinga först push av de omskrivna grenarna; att ta bort de gamla commitsen innan dess skulle göra den tvingade pushen omöjlig.";
"A fetch is running in this repository. Try again when it has finished." = "En fetch körs i det här förrådet. Försök igen när den är klar.";
"only the newest %lld commits are searched" = "endast de %lld senaste commitsen genomsöks";
